{
  "_about": "Approved sources for skill-finder: this list plus every marketplace the user has added to Claude Code (read live from known_marketplaces.json). Remote sources are indexed by 'finder.py index' into index/ and shipped with the skill; local sources are scanned live at search time and never shipped. A new remote source needs its own loader in finder.py. Mark: anthropic (written by Anthropic), curated (hand-picked list), reviewed (directory review done), otherwise unaudited.",
